# Hyperactive Amateur environment variables
# Copy to .env.local and fill in real values. Never commit .env.local.

# Google AI Studio API key for Gemini.
# Powers auto-tagging clips, "Suggest a beat", and the variation buttons.
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey (free tier; not a
# Google Cloud key).
# DEV ONLY: this is bundled into the client at build time.
# Migrate to a server proxy before any public deploy (see docs/AI-MIGRATION.md).
GEMINI_API_KEY=
